{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國總統特朗普周二（3日）稱，已與以色列總理內塔尼亞胡達成協議，年底停止每年向以方提供40億美元（約312億港元）援助，理由是以色列已不再需要，且這筆援助成為民主黨及左翼政客攻擊共和黨的話柄。</p><p>路透社稱，以方總理辦公室未即時回應。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:41:03.841315+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:16:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T21:58:16.233679+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:38:18.575933+00:00","content_hash":"471d0584ec1488f3f5ca735f7c0d1ffc91ca93a93727e7995cad7f9a0cda601f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}